flowchart TB
    accTitle: FoodWarden system overview
    accDescr: The fridge sensor sends encrypted readings to the camera gateway. The gateway controls the door locally and sends data to Cloudflare.
    %% Source topology: Fridge.drawio, Page-1, updated for Full Cloudflare server stack. See network.mmd and cloud.mmd for external links and internals.

    fridge_sensor["F0 · Fridge sensor<br/>Temperature, VOC and light"]
    gateway["C0 · Camera and gateway<br/>Local vision, BLE client and MQTT broker"]
    door["D0 · Door closer<br/>Motor, obstruction and limit sensors"]
    cloudflare["S · Cloudflare backend<br/>Workers, D1, R2 and Durable Objects"]
    dashboard["Phone or computer<br/>Food, device status and sensor history"]
    gemini["G · Gemini API<br/>Grocery recognition"]
    line["L · LINE Messaging API<br/>Expiry and safety alerts"]

    fridge_sensor <-->|"BLE GATT · AES-128-GCM"| gateway
    gateway <-->|"Local MQTT over TLS"| door
    gateway -->|"HTTPS · telemetry and device status"| cloudflare
    cloudflare <-->|"HTTPS · grocery images and candidates"| gemini
    cloudflare -->|"HTTPS · LINE push messages"| line
    dashboard <-->|"Google OAuth · live WSS and photos"| cloudflare